[280.904265, "o", "> "]
[280.904381, "o", "3. The `handle_event(internal, {conn_msg,Msg}, StateName, ...)` clause at line 771 processes these messages\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[280.904502, "o", "4. This handler calls `ssh_connection:handle_msg()` regardless of the `StateName`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[280.904653, "o", "5. For \"exec\" requests, this eventually calls `handle_cli_msg()` in `ssh_connection.erl`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
