[280.907213, "o", "1. **Pattern Matching**: The new clause matches `conn_msg` events before the original handler\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[280.907309, "o", "2. **State Validation**: Uses guard clauses to check if the state is NOT one of:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
