[280.908231, "o", "3. **Rejection**: If in an unauthenticated state, sends `SSH_DISCONNECT_PROTOCOL_ERROR` and closes the connection\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[280.908415, "o", "4. **Fallthrough**: If authenticated or renegotiating, the message falls through to the original handler (line 771)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[280.908473, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[280.908539, "o", "### Security Impact\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
